@startuml
title TARGET login - sesiones opacas DB
actor Owner
participant "Web Browser" as web
participant "Mobile / SecureStore" as mobile
participant "API Better Auth" as auth
database "Auth DB" as db
Owner -> web : Email/password
web -> auth : sign-in/email HTTPS
auth -> db : Validar hash / crear sesion
db --> auth : Sesion opaca
auth --> web : Set-Cookie host-only Secure HttpOnly
web -> auth : /v1/me credentials + Origin
auth -> db : Sesion + owner/business
auth --> web : Contexto propio / habilitacion
Owner -> mobile : Login cloud opcional
mobile -> auth : Plugin Expo sign-in/email
auth -> db : Crear otra sesion
auth --> mobile : Plugin persiste cookie en SecureStore
note over mobile : Sesion expirada pausa sync; local sigue operativo.
@enduml
